{"4271390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Asodium", "steam_appid": 4271390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Asodium</strong> is a short, atmospheric horror experience focused on tension, exploration, and unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a long-abandoned asylum, you must navigate its decaying halls while piecing together fragments of what this place once was—and why it was sealed away. The environment itself tells a story through scattered notes, distorted memories, and unsettling details that suggest something went deeply wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid confrontation at all costs. You are vulnerable, outmatched, and never truly alone. Learning the layout, knowing when to hide, and paying attention to your surroundings are essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Asodium prioritizes mood and psychological tension over action, delivering a focused experience designed to linger in the player’s mind long after it ends. Nothing is explained outright, and the truth reveals itself only to those willing to look closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some doors are better left unopened.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Asodium</strong> is a short, atmospheric horror experience focused on tension, exploration, and unease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a long-abandoned asylum, you must navigate its decaying halls while piecing together fragments of what this place once was—and why it was sealed away. The environment itself tells a story through scattered notes, distorted memories, and unsettling details that suggest something went deeply wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid confrontation at all costs. You are vulnerable, outmatched, and never truly alone. Learning the layout, knowing when to hide, and paying attention to your surroundings are essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_para